    <div id="introduction" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">At <strong>Algarve WebCraft</strong>, your privacy matters — even if we don’t collect any personal data directly through this website. This policy outlines what little information may be collected indirectly and how we handle it.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="collect" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">2. What We Collect</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">We do not actively collect, store, or process any personal data through this website. There are:</p>
      <ul class="cmp-main-text terms-privacy-list">
        <li>No contact forms</li>
        <li>No user accounts or logins</li>
        <li>No analytics or tracking tools</li>
        <li>No advertising scripts or third-party marketing pixels</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div id="how-to-contact" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">3. How You Can Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">If you choose to reach out, you can do so via:</p>
      <ul class="cmp-main-text terms-privacy-list">
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:algarvewebcraft@gmail.com">algarvewebcraft@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li>WhatsApp: Contact link provided on the website</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">When you contact us, we’ll only use your information (such as your email or phone number) to respond to your inquiry. We don’t store or share these details beyond that purpose.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="hosting" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">4. Hosting and Automatic Data</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">This website is hosted on <strong>Netlify</strong>. Netlify may automatically log non-personal information such as:</p>
      <ul class="cmp-main-text terms-privacy-list">
        <li>Your IP address</li>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Date and time of visit</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">This data is handled by Netlify and is used solely for technical performance and security. Algarve WebCraft does not access or analyze these logs.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="cookies" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">This site does not use cookies intentionally or for tracking. However, some cookies may be applied automatically by your browser or the hosting provider (Netlify) for technical purposes. We do not use any third-party or advertising cookies.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="data" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">6. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">We do not share, sell, or transfer any information to third parties — simply because we do not collect it in the first place.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="links" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">7. External Links</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">This website may contain links to other websites (such as portfolio examples or contact tools). We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of any external sites you may visit through those links.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="children" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">This site is intended for adults and businesses. We do not knowingly collect any data from children under 13 years of age. If you're a parent and believe your child has contacted us, please let us know and we’ll remove any communication immediately.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="rights" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">9. Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">Under GDPR and other data protection laws, you have the right to request access, correction, or deletion of your personal data. However, since we do not store any personal information, there is typically nothing for us to provide or delete.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="changes" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">We may update this privacy policy if our website or communication practices change. The latest version will always be available on this page with an updated date at the top.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="contact" class="terms-privacy-section">
      <h2 class="cmp-sub-heading cmp-sub-heading--terms-privacy">11. Contact</h2>
      <p class="cmp-main-text">If you have any questions or concerns about this privacy policy, please get in touch:</p>
      <ul class="cmp-main-text terms-privacy-list">
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:algarvewebcraft@gmail.com">algarvewebcraft@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li>Location: Lagos, Portugal</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
